      "width": 98,
      "height": 17.5,
      "text": "携带与使用规则",
      "originalText": "携带与使用规则",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0368",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 164596591,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 190726658,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272,
      "y": 828,
      "width": 344.25,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 携带槽固定 5 格，L0 即解锁，不随等级成长；同类可叠放。",
      "originalText": "• 携带槽固定 5 格，L0 即解锁，不随等级成长；同类可叠放。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0369",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 3501660537,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1186100356,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 298.75,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 进图不消耗，使用才消耗；3 种药水共享 5 秒冷却。",
      "originalText": "• 进图不消耗，使用才消耗；3 种药水共享 5 秒冷却。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0370",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 1322219027,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1843299414,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272,
      "y": 872,
      "width": 298.75,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 被困 / 倒地时不可使用；恢复不超过当前血量上限。",
      "originalText": "• 被困 / 倒地时不可使用；恢复不超过当前血量上限。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0371",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 1708912573,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1939107320,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 828,
      "width": 361.25,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 药水恢复固定 500 / 1000 / 2000，不随等级或血量上限放大。",
      "originalText": "• 药水恢复固定 500 / 1000 / 2000，不随等级或血量上限放大。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0372",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 4227946743,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1108468202,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 321.25,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 5 槽是上限，不是每局必须带满；材料充足，按需合成。",
      "originalText": "• 5 槽是上限，不是每局必须带满；材料充足，按需合成。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0373",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6B7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 3342116929,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3279840428,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 872,
      "width": 335,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "• 药水是唯一主动降难手段；后期相对变弱，不能抹平新图。",
      "originalText": "• 药水是唯一主动降难手段；后期相对变弱，不能抹平新图。",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 11,
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0374",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3B82F6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 1522702363,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 999190206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 412.5,
      "height": 15.625,
      "text": "定位：降低过关难度，不改变永久强度；固定恢复值，等级越高相对越弱。",
      "originalText": "定位：降低过关难度，不改变永久强度；固定恢复值，等级越高相对越弱。",
